  <rms:rms_experience_4_dateEndFormat>January 2006</rms:rms_experience_4_dateEndFormat>
  <rms:rms_experience_4_dateEndTS>1538352000</rms:rms_experience_4_dateEndTS>
  <rms:rms_experience_4_description>Implemented backend features during a Java internship, developing REST APIs and core modules for internal applications.
Prior to the internship, built multiple frontend projects using JavaScript (Vue2, jQuery), HTML/CSS, and Bootstrap to strengthen practical development skills.
Gained hands-on experience in UI development, responsive design, and modular code architecture through independent and academic projects.</rms:rms_experience_4_description>
  <rms:rms_experience_4_isCurrent>false</rms:rms_experience_4_isCurrent>
