  <rms:rms_project_1_description>Developed an encrypted environment variable manager for Python with no external dependencies, enabling cross-environment compatibility.
Engineered a cross-platform tool for securely managing environment variables, ensuring compatibility across diverse deployment scenarios while eliminating reliance on external libraries.</rms:rms_project_1_description>
