  <rms:rms_summary>Senior Backend Engineer with 7+ years of experience in Python, specializing in scalable systems, data pipelines, and API development. Proven track record in designing microservices and high-performance architectures using Django and FastAPI. Strong background in data engineering concepts, including ETL processes, data modeling, and handling large-scale data systems. Experienced with cloud-native tools such as Docker and Kubernetes, with a focus on building reliable and secure data-driven applications.</rms:rms_summary>
